    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d717">

                <pb facs="0832" n="746" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg746"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-05"><hi rendition="#italic">March 5,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that the statement made by the minister for foreign affairs
                    several weeks ago to the effect that the question of <pb facs="0833" n="747"
                        xml:id="pg747"/> examinations of the students of American medical school at
                    Beirut had been favorably acted upon is officially confirmed by a note verbale,
                    dated March 5, advising that an Imperial iradé has been issued authorizing the
                    sending of a special jury to Beirut to participate in the examinations.)</p>
            </div>
